shadow soldier~
a Shadow Soldier~
A shadowy warrior stands ready for combat.
~
Vaguely humanoid, this mass of darkness is nonetheless
recognizable as a soldier.  As the shadow moves, a trail
of darkness fades behind it.  In it's hand is a spear
composed apparently of nothing but negative energy.
~
