#20
islamic fundamentalist~
an Islamic Fundamentalist~
An Islamic terrorist is here, looking for an American to kill
~
Islamic Fundamentalists represent one of the worst aspects of humanity:
our ability to be trained to think in such an irrational manner that we
become subhuman.  Raised in a militant and fundamentalist belief in the
superiority of Islam and the righteousness of war against the pagan,
this human is willing to sacrifice their life to kill people whom they
have never seen and know little or nothing about.
~
97 8232 0 S
50 0 0 0d0+0 0d0+0
0 0
0 0 0
>fight_prog 20~
say Allah be praised!
~
>fight_prog 20~
say Death to the great satan
~
